Build lobo-agent, zip it with release.json, scan for secrets, upload to bucket lobo

Usage:
  lobo release [OPTIONS]

Flags:
  -h, --help  help for release

Global Flags:
      --config <string>  config file (dotenv; the OS env is never read) [default: /home/u/.config/lobo/config.env]
